<title>BELGIUM: Belgium's Hamon begins Brussels trade. [corrected 09:56 gmt]</title>
<headline>Belgium's Hamon begins Brussels trade. [corrected 09:56 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian cooling tower maker Hamon begins trade today on the Brussels Stock Exchange's twice daily fixed spot market following an initial public offering two weeks ago that was eleven (corrects from six) times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Hamon sold 325,000 shares with reduced withholding tax VVPR strips at a price of 2,280 francs.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
